Third-party software
--------------------

celld uses lol_html, Cloudflare's HTML rewriting library (BSD-3-Clause,
https://github.com/cloudflare/lol-html), to implement the HTMLRewriter
API. lol_html depends on the following crates from the Servo project,
which are licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
(https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). celld binaries include them unmodified;
cssparser-macros runs only at build time. Their source code is available
at:

  cssparser          https://crates.io/crates/cssparser
  cssparser-macros   https://crates.io/crates/cssparser-macros
  dtoa-short         https://crates.io/crates/dtoa-short
  selectors          https://crates.io/crates/selectors

The exact versions are recorded in Cargo.lock.

All other dependencies are under permissive licenses (Apache-2.0, MIT,
BSD-3-Clause, ISC, Unicode-3.0, Zlib, BSL-1.0, CC0-1.0,
CDLA-Permissive-2.0); Cargo.lock lists them.
